# From "Exploring Intuition" (Wave V - Exploring Focus 15, CD2-3). Follows
# discovering-intuition.gws with the same "plus know now" trigger, badly
# ASR-garbled in this source too and reconstructed the same way -- see the
# note in discovering-intuition.gws.

@segment  exploring-intuition
@title    Exploring Intuition
@levels   F12
@duration ~5m

say In Focus 12, let your consciousness expand further still. Deeper, well beyond your five physical senses.
pause 8
say Express your intent to know yourself more fully as an intuitive being, and your relationship to the source of that intuition.
pause 8
say From this expanded place, look for any obstacles in you that get in the way of trusting yourself as intuitive. Ask for help identifying any limiting beliefs.
pause 12
say Now express your intent to release them. Let them drift up and away, one by one, easily and gently. Feel lighter as they go.
pause 12
say You're free now to go deeper — into communication with this wise, knowing part of you.
pause 6
say Express your sincere intent to know it more fully. Its relationship to you. Its own particular way of speaking to you.
pause 8
say Invite it to communicate. To answer a question, if you have one. To offer whatever's needed. Whatever's right for you, right now.
pause 8
say I'll call you when it's time to return.
hold 120
say From now on, whenever you want to know something clearly: inhale, remember your own unique feeling, and say in your mind — plus know now. Plus know now. Then exhale.
pause 8
say Do this, and your perception opens beyond the five senses. You'll know what you need to know, and what to do about it.
pause 8
say The more you practice this, the easier and more effective it becomes.
pause 6
say Give thanks now, for this deeper trust and awareness.
pause 6
